# Root wrapper failure

The first functions.exec attempt to construct the additive prerequisite v2 auditor failed during JavaScript parsing: `SyntaxError: missing ) after argument list` (an invalid triple-quoted JavaScript string). No nested tool call, source edit, audit, native call, or SSH command from that attempt executed. This note preserves the diagnostic as decoded tool transcript text only; no original binary stderr is claimed. The prior v1 auditor and its successful receipt remain unchanged.
